          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conduit 無法連線到 Hermes，因此已將其保留在手機上。它會隨下一個事件一起傳送，或打開 Conduit。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conduit couldn't reach Hermes, so this wasn't kept. Open Conduit once, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
